      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just stress tho. it's more like... if the person who had those memories and that connection is already gone, then what am i actually saving? it feels like i'm just a hollow shell waiting to catch up to the emptiness. i'm just tired of being a spectator in a life i don't even recognize.",
