    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there's nothing left to reclaim? it feels like the \"me\" that could benefit from those things is already extinct. it's just this ghost haunting a body. if there's no core person left to actually experience the world, does it even make sense to keep dragging this shell around?",
